      "title": "Contrasts That Matter",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Some English words point to more than one Norwegian choice. The clearest choices come from the job of the clause: reason, one past time, repeated time, condition, or whether."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Because: "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "fordi",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " or "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "for",
              "lang": "no"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Fordi",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " is a subordinating conjunction: it starts a dependent reason clause. "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "For",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " is a coordinating conjunction, a joining word that links two main clauses. Use "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "fordi",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " when the because part is clearly dependent on the main idea."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Jeg blir hjemme fordi jeg er syk."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I am staying home because I am sick."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
